AtumModuleFactory_Constructor
├── when permit2 is zero address
│   └── it should revert with AtumModuleFactory_ZeroPermit2
├── when permit2 has no code
│   └── it should revert with AtumModuleFactory_Permit2NotContract
├── when the PaymentRailsFactory is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with AtumModuleFactory_ZeroPaymentRailsFactory
├── when the PaymentRailsFactory has no code
│   └── it should revert with AtumModuleFactory_PaymentRailsFactoryNotContract
└── when permit2 is a valid contract
    └── it should set permit2 and the PaymentRailsFactory
